1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,850
You can't out-train bad sleep. Here's why sleep matters more than you think.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,529
While you sleep, your body repairs muscle and releases growth hormone.

3
00:00:11,679 --> 00:00:15,154
Your brain clears out waste and saves what you learned that day.

4
00:00:16,304 --> 00:00:20,953
Short on sleep? Your hunger hormones rise, so you crave more junk food.

5
00:00:22,103 --> 00:00:25,835
Even one bad night can make you moody and slow to focus.

6
00:00:26,985 --> 00:00:32,414
Most adults need seven to nine hours. Try to go to bed at the same time every night.

7
00:00:33,764 --> 00:00:37,379
How many hours did you sleep last night? Tell me in the comments.

8
00:00:39,029 --> 00:00:41,790
Follow me for more health and wellness content.

